  "ruleText": "Env-A 101.301 “Wet methods”, #6482-A, effective 4-1-97\n\nREVISION NOTE #2:\n\nDocument #8304, effective 3-15-05, repealed 2 definitions in Env-A 100 and readopted with amendments and renumbered many other definitions in Env-A 100 as definitions in Env-A 1802.01 relative to asbestos management and control. These actions necessitated extensive renumbering of most of the remaining definitions in Env-A 100, as indicated in the source notes referencing Document #8304 below.\n\nThe definitions repealed by Document #8304 include the following terms and phrases. The prior documents containing the definitions are identified in Document #8304 as follows:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a100.html"
